### 定义全局基础路径（可根据你的服务端口修改）
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081

### 测试RocketMq消息发送
GET {{baseUrl}}/sendRocketMsg?msg=Hello_RocketMQ_5_from_Gavin
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

### 测试RocketMq对象消息发送
POST {{baseUrl}}/sendRocketObj
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "userName": "GavinXue",
  "phone": "13812345678",
  "age": 28
}

### 测试RocketMq事务消息发送
GET {{baseUrl}}/sendRocketTransaction?msg=Hello_RocketMQ_Transaction
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json